{'symbol': 'CTSH', 'date': '2022-03-02 06:30:00', 'title': 'COGNIZANT NAMES STEPHEN ROHLEDER TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'TEANECK, N.J., MARCH 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- COGNIZANT (NASDAQ: CTSH) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ON MARCH 1, 2022, STEPHEN ("STEVE") ROHLEDER WAS APPOINTED TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS AS A NEW INDEPENDENT DIRECTOR, EFFECTIVE MARCH 2, 2022.'}